   "heading": "GEOMETRIC TRIANGULATIONS OF A FAMILY OF HYPERBOLIC 3-BRAIDS 1. Introduction A knot or link in S 3 is hyperbolic if its complement admits a complete hyperbolic structure. A braid on n strands, which is represented by a word in the braid group, w ∈ B n , is hyperbolic if its braid closure, L w , is. H",
